{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >AI Simulation with High Customization</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this game you observe customized AI nations battle it out to ultimately try to control the world in a massive free-for-all, featuring alliances, revolts, puppet states and all kinds of political twists!<br><strong>NOTE: This is not a Strategy Game.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2186320/extras/f082cf73809ebef2a465690de1903e77.poster.avif?t=1763060732\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2186320/extras/f082cf73809ebef2a465690de1903e77.webm?t=1763060732\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2186320/extras/f082cf73809ebef2a465690de1903e77.mp4?t=1763060732\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Extensive Map Creator + God Mode Tools</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game comes with premade Maps and Scenarios, but you can unleash your creativity by making your own! <u><strong>Make your maps and borders as complex as you like!</strong></u><strong>\u00a0</strong>Check out\u00a0<strong><u>hundreds of High Quality Scenarios on Steam Workshop</u></strong> from historical periods to fantasy worlds!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2186320/extras/2d09cc45c381e983087e7e26ed2f3e88.poster.avif?t=1763060732\" width=600 height=288 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2186320/extras/2d09cc45c381e983087e7e26ed2f3e88.webm?t=1763060732\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2186320/extras/2d09cc45c381e983087e7e26ed2f3e88.mp4?t=1763060732\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Govern world history by controlling nations directly. Carefully edit borders, terrain, nation stats and AI behaviour at any point during the simulation!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >World Building</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >View the whole History of your simulations and Statistics to get a better view of past events and nations long gone. With the right settings, the world can continue to change for thousands of years.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2186320/extras/cb76cb447c387992cc046976ae0d35cb.poster.avif?t=1763060732\" width=600 height=262 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2186320/extras/cb76cb447c387992cc046976ae0d35cb.webm?t=1763060732\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2186320/extras/cb76cb447c387992cc046976ae0d35cb.mp4?t=1763060732\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you are interested in <strong>History, Geography, Map Painting</strong> or watching chaos unfold, Ages of Conflict has got you covered!</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Beginner Map Maker","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2186320/de4eeb3dfc51b833ad4edede94c34442f3e6fa38.jpg"},{"name":"Geopolitical Architect","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2186320/568120efa04cb66b62ba39414a2d158638ea96fa.jpg"},{"name":"Member of the Community","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2186320/08b712e8b62e8df35764b97067e2bcbb48452ac2.jpg"},{"name":"Making History","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2186320/acbe79bddc785ebe893aa83fce0df0d1cb0576df.jpg"},{"name":"Eternal Observer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2186320/23e518779a40f652ccc5f38c1de9ee8bf7fa180c.jpg"},{"name":"God Complex","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2186320/3f812227d048699c5c2c8c4faece61b763ef03b8.jpg"},{"name":"Last One Standing","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2186320/7692022f8927f868c67298d01b033dd52625260d.jpg"},{"name":"From Rags to Riches","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2186320/5f4bf63b6c50a587a73479b6d24db564d6bbbb26.jpg"},{"name":"Power to the People","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2186320/e2b704e3d713beca26227f737b399980fdc32270.jpg"},{"name":"Unbreakable Spirit","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2186320/fa2bacafbf602573757bb50ae5ab4830c70dedea.jpg"}],"total":11},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2186320?t=1763060732","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2186320/bea6848ce1cb9a179c0e49a6e1d8621694e77e33/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1763060732","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2186320/4828dd797ee0949b3007217faa986af3770a2c63/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1763060732","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2186320/4828dd797ee0949b3007217faa986af3770a2c63/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1763060732","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Workshop","id":30},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Includes level editor","id":17},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h1>Chat with us!</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2186320/extras/ea5fd1a64fbb86355eec5ae3b4928ded.avif?t=1763060732\" width=600 height=84 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Link in the information block \u279c</p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >AI Simulation with High Customization</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this game you observe customized AI nations battle it out to ultimately try to control the world in a massive free-for-all, featuring alliances, revolts, puppet states and all kinds of political twists!<br><strong>NOTE: This is not a Strategy Game.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2186320/extras/f082cf73809ebef2a465690de1903e77.poster.avif?t=1763060732\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2186320/extras/f082cf73809ebef2a465690de1903e77.webm?t=1763060732\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2186320/extras/f082cf73809ebef2a465690de1903e77.mp4?t=1763060732\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Extensive Map Creator + God Mode Tools</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game comes with premade Maps and Scenarios, but you can unleash your creativity by making your own! <u><strong>Make your maps and borders as complex as you like!</strong></u><strong>\u00a0</strong>Check out\u00a0<strong><u>hundreds of High Quality Scenarios on Steam Workshop</u></strong> from historical periods to fantasy worlds!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2186320/extras/2d09cc45c381e983087e7e26ed2f3e88.poster.avif?t=1763060732\" width=600 height=288 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2186320/extras/2d09cc45c381e983087e7e26ed2f3e88.webm?t=1763060732\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2186320/extras/2d09cc45c381e983087e7e26ed2f3e88.mp4?t=1763060732\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Govern world history by controlling nations directly. Carefully edit borders, terrain, nation stats and AI behaviour at any point during the simulation!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >World Building</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >View the whole History of your simulations and Statistics to get a better view of past events and nations long gone. With the right settings, the world can continue to change for thousands of years.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2186320/extras/cb76cb447c387992cc046976ae0d35cb.poster.avif?t=1763060732\" width=600 height=262 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2186320/extras/cb76cb447c387992cc046976ae0d35cb.webm?t=1763060732\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\